# A deletion made only in the given branch is applied without conflict.
I setup2.inc
> branch other
<<<
> checkout other
<<<
> rm g.txt
<<<
> commit "Remove g on other"
<<<
> checkout master
<<<
+ h.txt wug2.txt
> add h.txt
<<<
> commit "Add h on master"
<<<
> merge other
<<<
* g.txt
= f.txt wug.txt
= h.txt wug2.txt
> log
===
